# Cross-feature imports this project ACCEPTS, each with the reason it is not fixed yet.
#
# `02-architecture.md` forbids `features/*` importing another `features/*`. A line here is
# a crossing we have chosen to keep, so `tool/check_boundaries.py` reports it as DECLARED
# rather than failing — and a crossing that is neither fixed nor listed here still fails.
