# ⚠️ **THIS FILE IS EMPTY, AND THAT IS THE POINT.** It held three entries on 2026-10-04 —
# `settings` reaching into `features/history` for its retention providers and for a
# timestamp formatter. All three are fixed: the providers and `HistoryRetentionNotifier`
# moved to `data/history/`, the database provider to `core/database/`, the library providers
# to `data/library/`, and the time labels to `core/ui/` beside the other labels.
#
# ⚠️ **Keep it that way.** An allowlist that grows is a rule that has stopped being one; its
# value is that it is empty. Add an entry only with a reason that says what would let you
# remove it.

